# World War Hulk's chapter I made its effect with "red or green" as its text read when it resolved (CR 612.1, 608.2h): a Sleight
# of Mind that changes the Saga's "green" to "blue" afterwards changes the Saga's text, not the effect already made. So a blue
# Coral Merfolk is not offered the free cast, Runeclaw Bear ({1}{G}) still is and is cast with nothing spent, and the Bear uses
# the effect up (CR 611.2c), judged by the same words: the red Raging Goblin after it is not offered it either.

